# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Growlith Engine — .gitignore
#
# ARCHITECTURAL NOTE (ADR-0001, risk B-1):
# This file is intentionally the first file committed to the repository. The
# single highest-consequence failure mode in a Supabase-backed application is a
# `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` reaching git history: that role holds BYPASSRLS, so
# one leaked key silently removes tenant isolation for every client organization.
# Secrets in git history are effectively unrecoverable, so the ignore rules below
# are treated as a security control, not as housekeeping.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets & environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every dotenv file is ignored. `.env.example` is the ONLY tracked env file and
# must contain placeholders exclusively (never a real value).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets.json
**/service-account*.json

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
jspm_packages/

# ── Next.js build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
next-env.d.ts
.vercel/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Test & coverage output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
playwright/.cache/

# ── Supabase local stack ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The local CLI stack writes a full database, auth and storage state here.
# It is machine-local, large, and must never be committed.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.dist/

# ── Tooling caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.turbo/
.node_repl_history
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Local data dumps (Rule 13: no production data in the repository) ─────────
*.sql.gz
*.dump
*.csv
!.github/**/*.csv
tmp/
scratch/
